# A14 result

`FAIL_STUCK_INPUT_ON_OWNER_SERVICE_DEATH`: After owner service SIGKILL, the process was zombie while session remained alive and no receipt existed. Over 4 seconds, neither keymap bit became up and Button1 remained down; one KeyRelease event for keycode 40 occurred without keymap-up. This is evidence against relying on X server disconnect to clear held state.
